0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-neutral max-w-none card p-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-600","children":"Personal finance guide"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mt-2","children":"SIP Planning Guide India"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Understand SIP returns, step-up investing, time horizon, and realistic mutual fund planning."}],[["$","section","SIP works best with time and consistency",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"SIP works best with time and consistency"}],[["$","p","A Systematic Investment Plan helps you invest a fixed amount regularly instead of waiting for the perfect market level. The biggest advantage is discipline: the money is invested before it can be spent elsewhere.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"A Systematic Investment Plan helps you invest a fixed amount regularly instead of waiting for the perfect market level. The biggest advantage is discipline: the money is invested before it can be spent elsewhere."}],["$","p","SIPs do not remove market risk, but they reduce the pressure of timing every purchase. Over long periods, regular investing can smooth out some volatility through rupee cost averaging.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"SIPs do not remove market risk, but they reduce the pressure of timing every purchase. Over long periods, regular investing can smooth out some volatility through rupee cost averaging."}]]]}],["$","section","Choose the SIP amount from the goal",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"Choose the SIP amount from the goal"}],[["$","p","The right SIP amount depends on the target amount, years available, expected return, and inflation. A child education goal, retirement goal, and car purchase goal should not use the same assumptions.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The right SIP amount depends on the target amount, years available, expected return, and inflation. A child education goal, retirement goal, and car purchase goal should not use the same assumptions."}],["$","p","Use conservative return assumptions for important goals. If your plan only works at a very high return, increase the monthly amount or extend the timeline.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Use conservative return assumptions for important goals. If your plan only works at a very high return, increase the monthly amount or extend the timeline."}]]]}],["$","section","Step-up SIP can close the gap",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"Step-up SIP can close the gap"}],[["$","p","Many salaried investors can increase SIPs each year as income grows. Even a 5% to 10% yearly step-up can reduce pressure compared with starting at a very high monthly SIP.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Many salaried investors can increase SIPs each year as income grows. Even a 5% to 10% yearly step-up can reduce pressure compared with starting at a very high monthly SIP."}],["$","p","Review SIPs annually after salary hikes, bonus payouts, tax changes, and major life events.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Review SIPs annually after salary hikes, bonus payouts, tax changes, and major life events."}]]]}]],"$L2","$L3"]}],null,"$L4"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"Ax3wWi7V9jZ9YxrzlbMEm"}
